# kin/youth/neck/kerchief: the youth's kerchief: a triangle of the accent knotted at the throat, its point on the chest,
# the knot's ends behind the neck (the back view); flow keys keep it still (it is short)
# KIN-YOUTH (P2b wave 2). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body youth
role neck kerchief
layer neck
anchor neck
keys neck

view D key rest origin 4 0
|mpnnnnom
|.mponnm.
|..mpnm..
|...mm...

view U key rest origin 4 0
|mpooonnm
|...mnm..
|...mm...

view R key rest origin 4 0
|.mpoonm
|m...mpm
|.....mm

view R key flow origin 4 0
|.mpoonm
|m...mpm
|.....mm

view R key flow2 origin 4 0
|.mpoonm
|mm..mpm
|.....mm

view L key rest origin 3 0
|mpoonm.
|mpm...m
|mm.....

view L key flow origin 3 0
|mpoonm.
|mpm...m
|mm.....

view L key flow2 origin 3 0
|mpoonm.
|mpm..mm
|mm.....

view L key lie origin 3 0
|mpoonm.
|mpm...m
|mm.....
